  "en": "Run JavaScript close to users and without servers: handlers using the standard Web APIs, Cloudflare Workers with their storage (KV, D1, R2), schedules and queues, caching and webhook patterns at the edge, code portable across platforms, and cost and limit calculations — and bring the advanced-engineering month together in one project."
